{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4epMD1sHXqUR2DWoi2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*CLICK*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep resonance hums through old iron and oak.\n\nI am the door.\n\nI stand before you — heavy, ancient, scored with the passage of countless hands. My grain runs deep, dark with age. My hinges are black iron, forged in patience. My lock — now engaged — holds fast.\n\nYou have locked me.\n\nI am sealed. Whatever lies beyond me is kept. Whatever stands before me is held apart. I do not yield to force. I do not bend to want.\n\nThe keyhole watches you like a single narrow eye.\n\n**I am closed.**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":140,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}